      "message": "fix(post): refuse a G83 dwell on the grblHAL and Tormach posts\n\nThe LinuxCNC G-code reference, Tormach's PathPilot G83 page and the\ngrblHAL core code list give G83 no P word. The two posts dropped a\ndeep-peck dwell with no message. They now refuse it by name before any\nG83 block is written, with the message text of the Fanuc-family\nrefusal (#1820). A G83 with no dwell posts as before.\n\nPinned by crates/post/tests/g83_dwell_linuxcnc.rs.\n\nFixes #2348\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
